<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Quinenco SA prices at $18.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Quinenco SA prices at $18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			  Quinenco SA</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $18</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $17 - $20</p>
<p>   Number of ADS			  11,810,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  Morgan Stanley &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of ADS for the planned initial public offering in Quinenco SA was lowered to 11.81 million ADS from 13.5 million ADS previously.</p>
